{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51432","headline":"题开元寺水阁（在宣州） · 赵嘏","name":"题开元寺水阁（在宣州）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年来独向此游频，谢氏青山与寺邻。\n朱槛夜飞溪路雪，碧林晴隔马蹄尘。\n波穿十里桥连寺，絮压千家柳送春。\n（《舆地纪胜》一九《宁国府》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}